    <item>
      <title>PHP 陣列操作：那些讓你意外的小陷阱(array_unique、array_filter)</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202310/php-array-pitfalls/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Oct 2023 11:25:57 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202310/php-array-pitfalls/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>技術教學</category>
      <description>我發現許多從其他程式語言轉來 PHP 的開發者，經常會在操作陣列時碰到意料之外的狀況（我就是受害者）。今天我要來談談 PHP 中的 array_unique 和 array_filter 函數，以及它們的行為與你想像中可能存在的差異。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202310/php-array-pitfalls/images/php-array-pitfalls-og_hu_cf8472b68b605288.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>我發現許多從其他程式語言轉來 PHP 的開發者，經常會在操作陣列時碰到意料之外的狀況（我就是受害者）。今天我要來談談 PHP 中的 <code>array_unique</code> 和 <code>array_filter</code> 函數，以及它們的行為與你想像中可能存在的差異。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202310/php-array-pitfalls/images/php-array-pitfalls-01.webp" width="1056" height="590" alt="PHP 陣列操作：那些讓你意外的小陷阱(array_unique、array_filter)（圖 1）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="-array_filter-的索引行為">🎭 Array_filter 的索引行為<a class="h-anchor" href="#-array_filter-%e7%9a%84%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e8%a1%8c%e7%82%ba" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>在 JavaScript 的世界中，我們用 <code>filter</code> 來過濾陣列，結果非常直觀。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">let</span> arr <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> [<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>];
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">let</span> filteredArr <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> arr.filter(value =&gt; value <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">&gt;</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>console.log(filteredArr); <span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic">// 看吧！直接返回 [3, 4]
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>但換到 PHP，<code>array_filter</code> 卻有點不一樣。使用它之後，你會發現原始的索引還在：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-php" data-lang="php"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">array</span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$filteredArr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> array_filter(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span>, <span style="color:#ff7b72">function</span>(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$value</span>) {
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#ff7b72">return</span> <span style="color:#79c0ff">$value</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">&gt;</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>;
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>});
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print_r(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$filteredArr</span>); <span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic">// 喔喔！結果是 Array ( [2] =&gt; 3 [3] =&gt; 4 )
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>這意味著如果你嘗試在過濾後的陣列上取得 <code>$filteredArr[0]</code>，會得到一個未定義的索引錯誤。</strong></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="-array_unique-的特殊之處">🎩 Array_unique 的特殊之處<a class="h-anchor" href="#-array_unique-%e7%9a%84%e7%89%b9%e6%ae%8a%e4%b9%8b%e8%99%95" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><code>array_unique</code> 函數在 PHP 中用於移除陣列中的重複值。</p>
<p>但小心！它也不會重新排列索引：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-php" data-lang="php"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">array</span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$uniqueArr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> array_unique(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print_r(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$uniqueArr</span>); <span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic">// 哇！這是什麼魔法？Array ( [0] =&gt; 1 [1] =&gt; 2 [3] =&gt; 3 [5] =&gt; 4 )
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>同樣的，如果你直接取得 <code>$uniqueArr[2]</code>會讓你再次掉入那恐怖的陷阱中！</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="-如何應對">🌈 如何應對？<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e5%a6%82%e4%bd%95%e6%87%89%e5%b0%8d" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>為了避免這些問題，建議在使用這些函數後，用 <code>array_values</code> 函數重設索引：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-php" data-lang="php"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72">array</span>(<span style="color:#a5d6ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#a5d6ff">4</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$filteredArr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> array_filter(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$arr</span>, <span style="color:#ff7b72">function</span>(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$value</span>) {
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#ff7b72">return</span> <span style="color:#79c0ff">$value</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">&gt;</span> <span style="color:#a5d6ff">2</span>;
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>});
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#79c0ff">$reIndexedArr</span> <span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">=</span> array_values(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$filteredArr</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print_r(<span style="color:#79c0ff">$reIndexedArr</span>); <span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic">// Array ( [0] =&gt; 3 [1] =&gt; 4 )
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>這樣，你就可以放心地存取 <code>$reIndexedArr[0]</code> 而不必擔心會遭遇未定義的索引。</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="-總結">🎉 總結<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e7%b8%bd%e7%b5%90" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>雖然 PHP 的陣列操作函數在某些方面與其他語言有所不同，但只要你了解這些差異並採取適當的預防措施，就可以順利避免可能的錯誤。</p>
<p>希望這篇文章能夠幫助你更深入地了解 PHP 的陣列操作 🚀</p>
]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Laravel常用指令</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202006/laravel-common-commands/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2020 17:05:47 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202006/laravel-common-commands/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>技術教學</category>
      <description>laravel有很多常用的指令，但有時候會忘記或是不想自己全部打完，那這篇文章就是你專門用來複製貼上的大補帖</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202006/laravel-common-commands/images/laravel-common-commands-og_hu_38f041d662499238.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202006/laravel-common-commands/images/laravel-common-commands-01.webp" width="1400" height="583" alt="Laravel常用指令（圖 1）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>這篇文章會列出我在使用Laraval框架時常用到的指令(部分是套件指令)</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="1-資料庫相關指令">1. 資料庫相關指令<a class="h-anchor" href="#1-%e8%b3%87%e6%96%99%e5%ba%ab%e7%9b%b8%e9%97%9c%e6%8c%87%e4%bb%a4" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>Migration 資料庫完全重新設定</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan migrate:refresh — seed
</code></pre><p><strong>備份應用程式包括資料庫，<a href="https://codertw.com/%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%8F%E8%AA%9E%E8%A8%80/190804/">請確認是否已經安裝plugin</a></strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan backup:run
</code></pre><p><strong>備份的資料庫執行</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan backup:run --only-db
</code></pre><p><strong>只需要備份的檔案</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan backup:run --only-files
</code></pre><p><strong>database 還原</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>mysql -u root -p database_name &lt; backup.sql
</code></pre><h2 id="2-安裝檔遺失相關issue">2. 安裝檔遺失相關issue<a class="h-anchor" href="#2-%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d%e6%aa%94%e9%81%ba%e5%a4%b1%e7%9b%b8%e9%97%9cissue" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>composer 全部砍掉重裝</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span>rm -rf vendor/
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>composer update -v
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="3-laravel-常用指令">3. Laravel 常用指令<a class="h-anchor" href="#3-laravel-%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e6%8c%87%e4%bb%a4" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>創建model</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:model Photo
</code></pre><p><strong>創建controller</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:controller UserController
</code></pre><p><strong>創建migration</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:migration create_users_table — table=users
</code></pre><p><strong>創建seeder</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:seeder UsersTableSeeder
</code></pre><p><strong>創建middleware</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:middleware CheckAge
</code></pre><p><strong>創建job</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:job SendReminderEmail
</code></pre><p><strong>創建testcase</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan make:test UserTest
</code></pre><h2 id="4-php相關指令">4. php相關指令<a class="h-anchor" href="#4-php%e7%9b%b8%e9%97%9c%e6%8c%87%e4%bb%a4" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>尋找php.ini</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span>sudo find / -name ‘php.ini’
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>更改php相關設定(如果遇到nginx 502也能用這個重啟嘗試看看)</strong></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>vi /etc/php/7.3/fpm/php.ini
service php7.3-fpm restart
</code></pre><h2 id="5-單元測試">5. 單元測試<a class="h-anchor" href="#5-%e5%96%ae%e5%85%83%e6%b8%ac%e8%a9%a6" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>./vendor/bin/phpunit
// 如果使用sudo權限來做測試，部分storage會變成admin權限，這個指令可以讓整個資料夾回歸www-data權限
chown -R www-data:www-data storage/
</code></pre><h2 id="6-排程相關">6. 排程相關<a class="h-anchor" href="#6-%e6%8e%92%e7%a8%8b%e7%9b%b8%e9%97%9c" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><strong>排程重啟supervisor</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span>// 檔案位置
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>/etc/supervisor/conf.d
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>// 每次修改需要執行這幾個指令重啟<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">(</span>開啟<span style="color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold">)</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>sudo supervisorctl reread
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>sudo supervisorctl update
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>sudo supervisorctl start laravel-worker:*
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>sudo supervisorctl restart laravel-worker:*
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>本機local端測試排程job</strong></p>
<p>下面幾種job為我個人將每個排程進行分類，讓需要較長時間的排程不會影響到其他短時間能完成的排程</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>php artisan queue:work — queue=small_job,default — timeout=600 — delay=3 — sleep=3 — tries=3
php artisan queue:work — queue=big_job,default — timeout=7200 — delay=3 — sleep=3 — tries=3
php artisan queue:work — queue=default — delay=3 — sleep=3 — tries=3
</code></pre><h2 id="7-查看錯誤訊息">7. 查看錯誤訊息<a class="h-anchor" href="#7-%e6%9f%a5%e7%9c%8b%e9%8c%af%e8%aa%a4%e8%a8%8a%e6%81%af" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>如果為 php 的錯誤訊息</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>vi /var/log/php7.3-fpm.log
</code></pre><p>如果為 Laravel 的錯誤訊息</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>vi project_path/storage/logs/laravel-xxx-xx.log
</code></pre><blockquote>
<p>從 log 就能推斷出大部分的問題，並取得查詢的關鍵字</p>
</blockquote>
]]></content:encoded>
